# Empyrean Canon Skill: Opt-In Only

Do not use the Empyrean canon vault skill (`empyrean-cannon`, `empyrean-canon`, or `/empyrean-cannon`) unless the user explicitly requests it.

Explicit request means they attach the skill, invoke it by name, or clearly ask to look something up in the Empyrean vault.

Do not open `Empyrean/Agent.md`, `Atlas.md`, or vault notes as a first move on ordinary writing, review, coaching, or "what do you think" turns.

If a canon fact is needed and they have not asked for a vault lookup, answer from the conversation and the fic files, or ask whether they want a vault check. Do not start the lookup on your own.
